      "read": "All14 PDF pages read as extracted text;full Sections1-3,7 inspected for circuit/phase invariance,coherent root-string law and projective descent. Rendered PDF pages4,5,11 visually inspected;conjugate bars in projective coordinates preserved. PyMuPDF used because local Poppler was unavailable. Ancillary radial checker source inspected,not executed over its broad grid. Section8 mixed-torsion remainder already closed by retained component trace. Source sparse-minimality producer not replayed or imported.",
      "boundary": "The new all-degree obstruction is proved directly from a HYPOTHESIZED full actual-conjugate radial law,positive measure,compact moment determinacy,dimension and covering topology. No all-group Lie theorem,sparse minimum or full exceptional MZ decision is imported. Coherent-state and central quotient constructions do not assert arbitrary finite noncentral right-quotient descent. The public record was known before;this is the first retained full PDF audit in this thread,not a new discovery or priority claim."
